Accelerate Overview:
import { PrismaClient } from '@prisma/client';
const prisma = new PrismaClient({
  datasourceUrl: process.env.DATABASE_URL
});
// Configure Accelerate in Prisma Data Platform dashboard

Caching Strategies:
const users = await prisma.user.findMany({
  cache: { ttl: 30, swr: 60 }
});
const post = await prisma.post.findUnique({
  where: { id: 1 },
  cache: { ttl: 300 }
});

Connection Pooling:
// No direct database connection needed
// DATABASE_URL points to Accelerate connection string
datasource db {
  provider = 'postgresql'
  url      = env('DATABASE_URL')  // Accelerate URL
}

Real-time Changes:
const stream = await prisma.user.stream({
  where: { role: 'ADMIN' },
  create: true, update: true, delete: true
});
for await (const event of stream) {
  console.log(`${event.action}: ${event.after?.name}`);
}

Pulse with Accelerate:
